OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FIt's all change at Barnsley
OL,7,     Fcasualty as a new system is
OL,8,     Fintroduced; Sister Benita takes on
OL,9,     Fthe role of team leader for the
OL,10,     Ffirst time; the staff treats
OL,11,     Fcritical patients.
OL,12,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA doctor has to apply more than
OL,14,     Ften surgical staples to finally
OL,15,     Fclose an open wound on a
OL,16,     Fpensioner's scalp; an elderly man
OL,17,     Ffalls down the stairs.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
