OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAn ambulance crew bring in a
OL,7,     Fpatient who acts aggressively and
OL,8,     Fis a regular at the hospital. And
OL,9,     Fa 45-year-old suffers
OL,10,     Flife-threatening anaphylaxis from
OL,11,     Fan allergic reaction.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FTwo grooms-to-be come to the
OL,14,     Fclinic with lumps they want to get
OL,15,     Frid of before their big days: Carl
OL,16,     Fhas multiple lipomas, while Alan
OL,17,     Fneeds a neck cyst removed.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
