OL,5,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,6,     FThe chilling story of a lodger
OL,7,     Ffrom Canterbury, Kent, who
OL,8,     Fmurdered his housemate and the
OL,9,     Fman's girlfriend after a row over
OL,10,     Fhot water.
OL,11,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,12,     FAfter two young girls were killed,
OL,13,     Fa mishandled prosecution ended in
OL,14,     Fa murderer walking free until a
OL,15,     Flater, more dedicated
OL,16,     Finvestigation brought him to
OL,17,     Fjustice.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
